msgstr "Filtern"

#: views/admin/tab-stats.php:157
msgid "No searches match. As soon as visitors search, their queries appear here."
msgstr "Keine passenden Suchen. Sobald Besucher suchen, erscheinen ihre Suchanfragen hier."

#: views/admin/tab-stats.php:159
